tle="West Falls Church, Virginia" id="mwLGU">West Falls Church, Virginia</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Census-designated_place" title="Census-designated place" id="mwLGY">census-designated place</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairfax_County,_Virginia" title="Fairfax County, Virginia" id="mwLGc">Fairfax County</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www2.census.gov/geo/maps/DC2020/DC20BLK/st51_va/place/p5184368_west_falls_church/DC20BLK_P5184368.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLGg">See map here</a>.<!--The HQ is actually in Fairfax County. In Virginia, cities are separate from counties. It is impossible for a place in Fairfax County to be in Falls Church city.--></span></li>
