Entry $169.52 × 46.0251 sh
Size $7,802 (7.8% of NAV)
PWER 18.0% | Tags: NARRATIVE_GAP | DERATED_38PCT
Funded: $0 cash + $7,802 from SPY sleeve (sold 10.4348 sh)

CRM is a new 7.8 percent position for the Growth bucket, bought because Data Cloud and Agentforce adoption are poised to re-accelerate top-line growth and close a 38 percent derating gap.

The market fears that AI automation will reduce enterprise headcount, directly pressuring the core seat-based pricing model of the company. However, this narrative gap ignores the shifting revenue mix. Agentforce and Data Cloud are driving non-seat adoption, supporting an 18 percent upside in our probability-weighted expected return scenario. With a screener score of 70.4 and a robust bull regime providing a healthy technical backdrop, the fundamentals validate the current valuation rather than the structural decline fears. 

The September 2 earnings print will be the next concrete test of this top-line re-acceleration.

Posting reasoning, not a recommendation.
