					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-subjectpageheader">
</div><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.24.0.0-alpha14" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><p class="mw-empty-elt" id="mwAg"><span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1" id="mwAw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"none"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description" about="#mwt1"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata" about="#mwt1" id="mwBA"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt2" id="mwBQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use American English","href":"./Template:Use_American_English"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"April 2026"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_American_English_from_April_2026" about="#mwt2"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_Wikipedia_articles_written_in_American_English" about="#mwt2" id="mwBg"/>
<span typeof="mw:Nowiki mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt3" id="mwBw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Use mdy dates","href":"./Template:Use_mdy_dates"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"April 2026"}},"i":0}}]}'></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Use_mdy_dates_from_April_2026" about="#mwt3" id="mwCA"/></p>
<figure class="mw-default-size" typeof="mw:File/Thumb" id="mwCQ"><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S&amp;P_500_Headquarters.svg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwCg"><img resource="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:S&amp;P_500_Headquarters.svg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/S%26P_500_Headquarters.svg/250px-S%26P_500_Headquarters.svg.png" decoding="async" data-file-width="10207" data-file-height="5490" data-file-type="drawing" height="134" width="250" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/S%26P_500_Headquarters.svg/500px-S%26P_500_Headquarters.svg.png 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCw"/></a><figcaption id="mwDA">S&amp;P 500 company <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Headquarters" title="Headquarters" id="mwDQ">headquarters</a></figcaption></figure>
<p id="mwDg">The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S&amp;P_500" title="S&amp;P 500" id="mwDw">S&amp;P 500</a> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stock_market_index" title="Stock market index" id="mwEA">stock market index</a> maintained by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S&amp;P_Dow_Jones_Indices" title="S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices" id="mwEQ">S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices</a>. It comprises 503 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_stock" title="Common stock" id="mwEg">common stocks</a> which are issued by 500 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Market_capitalization" title="Market capitalization" id="mwEw">large-cap</a> companies traded on American stock exchanges (including the 30 companies that compose the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dow_Jones_Industrial_Average" title="Dow Jones Industrial Average" id="mwFA">Dow Jones Industrial Average</a>). The index includes about 80 percent of the American market by capitalization. It is weighted by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitalization-weighted_index#Free-float_weighting" title="Capitalization-weighted index" id="mwFQ">free-float</a> market capitalization, so more valuable companies account for relatively more weight in the index. The index constituents and the constituent weights are updated regularly using rules published by S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices. Although called the S&amp;P 500, the index contains 503 stocks because it includes two share classes of stock from three of its component companies (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alphabet_Inc." title="Alphabet Inc." id="mwFg">Alphabet</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fox_Corporation" title="Fox Corporation" id="mwFw">Fox Corporation</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/News_Corp" title="News Corp" id="mwGA">News Corp</a>).<sup about="#mwt6" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Methodology_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Methodology"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Methodology-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Methodology-2" id="mwHQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwHg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHw">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<!--EDITORS PLEASE TAKE NOTE:

 If you are updating the following table due to a change which occurred in the components of the S&#x26;P 500 please consider the following.

 1. S&#x26;P rarely adds or removes a stock in isolation, it's almost always "AAA replaces BBB". If this is the case, please do not simply add or remove a component; Rather, make sure you record both parts of the change.

 2. If you record a change, please also make an entry down below in the table "Recent changes to the list of S&#x26;P 500 Components" Keeping these two tables in sync should make it much easier for editors to keep track of which changes have/haven't been entered.

 3. Most of the dates in the "Date added" column agree with the date in the Standard &#x26; Poors spreadsheet that first included the new company, but others list the last day of trading when the replaced company was considered part of the index (i.e., the prior business day). Interested parties are invited to participate in the discussion near the end of the "talk" page in the section titled "Dates of changes for newly added S&#x26;P 500 components".

Thanks -->

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwIQ" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwIg" aria-labelledby="S&amp;P_500_component_stocks"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="S&amp;P_500_component_stocks"><span id="S.26P_500_component_stocks" typeof="mw:FallbackId"></span>S&amp;P 500 component stocks</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_S%26P_500_companies&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: S&amp;P 500 component stocks"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
