<p id="mwFg">The <b id="mwFw">Nasdaq-100</b> is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stock_market_index" title="Stock market index" id="mwGA">stock market index</a> made up of equity securities issued by 100 of the largest non-financial companies listed on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq" title="Nasdaq" id="mwGQ">Nasdaq</a> stock exchange. The Nasdaq-100 is often abbreviated as NDX,<sup about="#mwt20" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwGg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHQ">]</span></span></a></sup> NDQ, NAS100, or US100.</p>

<p id="mwHg">The Nasdaq-100 index is a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_float" title="Public float" id="mwHw">public float</a> weighted/<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitalization-weighted_index" title="Capitalization-weighted index" id="mwIA">capitalization-weighted index</a>. As of July 2026, the 10 largest components account for approximately 48% of the market capitalization of the index and are, in order of highest to lowest weighting: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nvidia" title="Nvidia" id="mwIQ">Nvidia</a> (7.90%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apple_Inc." title="Apple Inc." id="mwIg">Apple</a> (7.36%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alphabet_Inc." title="Alphabet Inc." id="mwIw">Alphabet</a> (6.50%, including both class A &amp; C shares), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Micron_Technology" title="Micron Technology" id="mwJA">Micron Technology</a> (4.72%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft" title="Microsoft" id="mwJQ">Microsoft</a> (4.55%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_(company)" title="Amazon (company)" id="mwJg">Amazon</a> (4.19%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Micro_Devices" title="Advanced Micro Devices" class="mw-redirect" id="mwJw">Advanced Micro Devices</a> (3.72%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tesla,_Inc." title="Tesla, Inc." id="mwKA">Tesla</a> (3.15%), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broadcom" title="Broadcom" id="mwKQ">Broadcom</a> (2.95%), and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_Platforms" title="Meta Platforms" id="mwKg">Meta Platforms</a> (2.86%).<sup about="#mwt21" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-qqq_2-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"qqq"}}'><a href="#cite_note-qqq-2" id="mwKw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwLA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwLw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwMA" aria-labelledby="Investing_in_the_Nasdaq-100"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Investing_in_the_Nasdaq-100">Investing in the Nasdaq-100</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Nasdaq-100&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section's source code: Investing in the Nasdaq-100"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwMQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Index_fund" title="Index fund" id="mwMg">Index funds</a>, including <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mutual_fund" title="Mutual fund" id="mwMw">mutual funds</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchange-traded_fund" title="Exchange-traded fund" id="mwNA">exchange-traded funds</a> (ETFs), can replicate, before fees and expenses, the performance of the index by holding the same stocks as the index in the same proportions. Index funds that replicate the performance of the index are:</p>

<table class="wikitable sortable" id="mwNQ">
<tbody id="mwNg"><tr style="font-weight:bold; background-color:lightyellow; align:center;" id="mwNw">
<td colspan="4" id="mwOA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchange-traded_fund" title="Exchange-traded fund" id="mwOQ">Exchange-traded funds</a> - United States</td></tr>
<tr id="mwOg">
<th scope="col" id="mwOw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ticker_symbol" title="Ticker symbol" id="mwPA">Ticker symbol</a></th>
<th scope="col" id="mwPQ">Issuer</th>
<th scope="col" id="mwPg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Expense_ratio" title="Expense ratio" id="mwPw">Expense ratio</a></th>
