<p id="mwA1U">Related indices are:</p>
<ul id="mwA1Y"><li id="mwA1c"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq_Composite" title="Nasdaq Composite" id="mwA1g">Nasdaq Composite</a> - includes every company with a primary listing on the Nasdaq</li>
<li id="mwA1k"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq_Financial-100" title="Nasdaq Financial-100" id="mwA1o">Nasdaq Financial-100</a> (IXF) - includes the largest financial companies listed on the Nasdaq</li>
<li id="mwA1s">NASDAQ Q-50 (NXTQ) - includes the 50 stocks that are next eligible for inclusion in the Nasdaq-100</li>
<li id="mwA1w">NASDAQ-100 Technology Sector (NDXT) - an equal weighted index of companies in the Nasdaq-100 that have a ICB index classification of "Technology"</li></ul>

