<p id="mwA3E">Related indices are:</p>
<ul id="mwA3I"><li id="mwA3M"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq_Composite" title="Nasdaq Composite" id="mwA3Q">Nasdaq Composite</a> - includes every company with a primary listing on the Nasdaq</li>
<li id="mwA3U"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq_Financial-100" title="Nasdaq Financial-100" id="mwA3Y">Nasdaq Financial-100</a> (IXF) - includes the largest financial companies listed on the Nasdaq</li>
<li id="mwA3c">NASDAQ Q-50 (NXTQ) - includes the 50 stocks that are next eligible for inclusion in the Nasdaq-100</li>
<li id="mwA3g">NASDAQ-100 Technology Sector (NDXT) - an equal weighted index of components of the Nasdaq-100 that have an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industry_classification" title="Industry classification" id="mwA3k">industry classification</a> of "Technology" per the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Industry_Classification_Benchmark" title="Industry Classification Benchmark" id="mwA3o">Industry Classification Benchmark</a></li></ul>

